---
import Fn from '../primitives/Fn.astro';
---

<section class="section cpu" id="cpu" aria-labelledby="cpu-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="fade"><b>03</b> Nova on the CPU</p>
      <h2 id="cpu-title" class="display-2" data-reveal="lines">No GPU? Every core takes up the chase.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="cpu__cols" data-reveal="stagger" data-stagger="0.12" data-focus>
      <article class="cpu__col">
        <p class="caption">Intersection</p>
        <h3 class="display-3">Embree 4</h3>
        <p class="body">What did the ray hit?</p>
      </article>
      <article class="cpu__col">
        <p class="caption">Integration</p>
        <h3 class="display-3">Wavefront</h3>
        <p class="body">Where does it go next?</p>
      </article>
      <article class="cpu__col">
        <p class="caption">Shading</p>
        <h3 class="display-3">A SIMD VM</h3>
        <p class="body">
          What does it see there? A structural edit recompiles one material in about 0.1&nbsp;ms.<Fn id="shading-edit" />
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="cpu__rate" data-reveal="fade">
      <span class="cpu__rate-value num">21–38</span>
      <span class="cpu__rate-label">million rays per second on the reference scenes, on eight cores.<Fn id="cpu-rays" /></span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cpu__cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
  }
  .cpu__col {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .cpu__col .caption {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .cpu__rate {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cpu__rate-value {
    font-size: var(--display-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cpu__rate-label {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 22em;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cpu__cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .cpu__rate {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
